## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: brief outline of 3DMM fitting loop (high level)
function fit3DMM(frame, model) {
  const landmarks = detectLandmarks(frame);
  const pose = solvePnP(landmarks, model.meanShape);
  return {pose, coefficients: model.coeffs};
}
```

